{"last_link_id": 6, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "audio_output", "links": [6], "label": "audio_output", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio_output"}, {"name": "filepath", "label": "filepath", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filepath"}], "size": [400, 426], "pos": [208.456298828125, 799.6807861328125], "widgets_values": ["​[Verse] \n残阳把剑影拓在城砖上​\n青龙偃月劈开了寒霜​\n桃园的酒还在瓮里酿​\n马蹄已踏碎 洛阳的残阳​\n铜雀台的风 吹乱了诗行​\n赤壁的火 烧红了长江​\n草船借箭时 雾锁着迷茫​\n空城一曲 吓退了千军万马​\n[Chorus] \n烽火照肝胆 热血染征袍​\n三分天下的棋 谁能落最后一子​\n青龙偃月寒 丈八蛇矛啸​\n英雄的名字 在史书里 永远年少​\n​[Verse] \n白帝城托孤 泪湿了龙床​\n七擒孟获 心比泸水长​\n祁山的雪 埋了多少壮志​\n五丈原的星 落进谁眼眶​\n江东的月 照过周郎的伤​\n许昌的灯 映着阿瞒的狂​\n华容道的辙 碾过了过往​\n青梅煮酒 论尽了英雄何方​\n​[Chorus] \n烽火照肝胆 热血染征袍​\n三分天下的棋 谁能落最后一子​\n青龙偃月寒 丈八蛇矛啸​\n英雄的名字 在史书里 永远年少​\n​[Outro] \n青苔爬上了 古战场的墙​\n风吹过 谁还在唱​\n那些未写完的 春秋与兴亡", "R&B, drum machine, powerful, epic, Keyboard, electronic，clean female voice", "3B", "oss", 273107964103499, "randomize", 600, 50, 1, 1.5, true, "auto", false], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "lyrics"}, "name": "lyrics", "label": "lyrics", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "lyrics"}, {"widget": {"name": "tags"}, "name": "tags", "label": "tags", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "tags"}, {"widget": {"name": "version"}, "name": "version", "label": "version", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "version"}, {"widget": {"name": "codec_version"}, "name": "codec_version", "label": "codec_version", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "codec_version"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_audio_length_seconds"}, "name": "max_audio_length_seconds", "label": "max_audio_length_seconds", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_audio_length_seconds"}, {"widget": {"name": "topk"}, "name": "topk", "label": "topk", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "topk"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "cfg_scale"}, "name": "cfg_scale", "label": "cfg_scale", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "cfg_scale"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "offload_mode"}, "name": "offload_mode", "label": "offload_mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "offload_mode"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantize_4bit"}, "name": "quantize_4bit", "label": "quantize_4bit", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "quantize_4bit"}], "flags": {}, "id": 9, "type": "HeartMuLa_Generate", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "HeartMuLa_Generate"}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["1. max_audio_length_ms\n含义：最大音频长度，单位是毫秒（ms）\n作用：设置输入音频的最长允许时长。这里设为 240000，也就是240 秒（4 分钟）。\n超过这个时长的音频会被自动截断，确保模型处理的音频长度在设计范围内，避免内存溢出或性能问题。\n2. topk\n含义：Top-K 采样\n作用：生成时只从概率最高的前 K 个候选词中随机选择。这里设为 50。\n值越大，生成结果越丰富但可能发散；值越小，结果越聚焦但可能单调。\n它常用于文本生成、语音合成或音乐生成类模型，平衡多样性与连贯性。\n3. temperature\n含义：温度系数\n作用：控制生成结果的随机性。这里设为 1.0，是中性值。\n温度越高（>1），生成越随机、创意性越强；温度越低（<1），生成越保守、越倾向于高概率内容。\n1.0 表示完全按照模型预测的概率分布进行采样，不做额外调整。\n4. cfg_scale (Classifier-Free Guidance Scale)\n含义：无分类器引导系数\n作用：控制提示词（Prompt）对生成结果的影响强度。这里设为 1.5。\n值越高，生成结果越严格遵循提示词；值越低，生成结果更自由、受提示词约束更小。\n常见范围在 1~10 之间，1.5 属于较低的引导强度，适合希望保留一定生成自由度的场景。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [370.2872619628906, 274.8255920410156], "pos": [-182.0680389404297, 810.1275634765625], "id": 6, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [423.38555908203125, 209.80332946777344], "pos": [645.9278564453125, 804.0377197265625], "widgets_values": ["audio/ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 6, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget"